qIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aROhaLh-dqtt-h6BG-gn2w","review_id":"S5MR-gO184mH3fCrQBwY8A","date":"2014-10-26T19:44:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9447894096374512,"text_excerpt":"I love going out for breakfasts on Sunday morning that Tout De Suite did it right. I don't often make it over to the West Bank, and I never come out of Algiers Point, but it is an absolutely cute neighborhood. Having never been here, it was confusing that we weren't sure what to do when we first walked in. It turns out that you order at the counter and then someone will bring you food out as it is ready. When you're finished, there is a garbage can to the left of the counter where you bus your own dishes. I ordered the large con panna (espresso with whipped cream on top) and the traditional with a fried egg, potatoes, applewood bacon, and an engish muffin. My wife got the same thing (diff..."},{"business_id":"aROhaLh-dqtt-h6BG-gn2w","review_id":"AhwY50j9y6nUpyonoxtoTQ","date":"2019-11-06T00:16:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9341638684272766,"text_excerpt":"My friend and I came to Tout De Suite Cafe during our stay in Algiers. We kept passing by after it had closed but finally had the change to go the day before we left. Tout De Suite Cafe is one of those places that needs to be on your list of cafes to visit. The staff was friendly and helpful. You can tell that they really care about their customers and the food. I ended up ordering a breakfast option (I don't remember the name). My meal had the two slices of bacon, two eggs of my choice, grits, and an english muffin. I know you can customize the options but that's what I went with. I had been having stomach issues the days prior so this was a nice and light breakfast. The food was amazing..."},{"business_id":"aROhaLh-dqtt-h6BG-gn2w","review_id":"UtUbhYtbFb8oRI909IE0Mw","date":"2013-09-29T18:29:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9247220754623413,"text_excerpt":"Leisurely brunch this morning with good friends from out of town. They picked the spot, and I must say, what a gem! Tout De Suite is located in Algiers Point near the ferry landing. You stand in line, place your order, and wait for your meal to be served. My cafe au lait was spot on. Delicous. They do offer fresh squeezed oj, but they had run out, but will be sure to go earlier next time so chances will be better. I had the Katrita, which is a NOLA twist on huevos rancheros. My eggs were cooked to perfection, served with two types of cheese, black beans, salsa--I thoroughly enjoyed my food. My husband had the Farmer Brown, which was a nice pile of Potatoes O'Brien, topped with cheese, avo..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"aROhaLh-dqtt-h6BG-gn2w","photo_id":"cWL4V3wbmlEtZ9v5A6klrw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/cWL4V3wbmlEtZ9v5A6klrw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9148498773574829},{"business_id":"aROhaLh-dqtt-h6BG-gn2w","photo_id":"LmBwHTZ9ZoLYMdByft84sQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LmBwHTZ9ZoLYMdByft84sQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8362912535667419},{"business_id":"aROhaLh-dqtt-h6BG-gn2w","photo_id":"Mc0nbYsmdxofO21jY6-UCw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos